    "detailed_description": "<strong>Command an army to face off against your feline foes in a game of strategy, wits, and whiskers.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687500/extras/01f408b10920e660f56359d36993a660.avif?t=1706299780\" width=590 height=472 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Champions</h2><strong>Vibrant cast of 6 unique champions - </strong> Pick from six unique champions from the desert, grassland, and tundra kingdom. Discover their unique personalities through their voice acting. <br><strong>Use Your Specials to Turn the Tide of Battle - </strong> Each faction gives their champion a unique special ability. Spawn an ally from thin air to defend yourself as a tundra champion. Move an extra turn to get a kill on a faraway enemy as a grass champion. Teleport yourself out of harms way as a desert champion.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687500/extras/489eb49dbf7f6826bd6a856f0257d806.avif?t=1706299780\" width=588 height=184 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Units</h2><strong>Wide Array of 8 Different Units - </strong> Spawn from a selection of 8 different units on the ground and in the air! Utilize their strengths and weaknesses to gain an edge in combat.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategy</h2><strong>Position Your Units on Advantageous Terrains - </strong> Head into the mountains to escape an assassin. Use the cover of the forests to defend yourself from attacks.<br><strong>Give your units a boost - </strong> Capture Artifacts of Power and Key Locations to give yourself and your units a strategic edge. Artifacts of Power give buffs to the unit that captures it for as long as they live. Key Locations give entire team-wide buffs to whichever team holds the location.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer</h2>Play against a computer controlled opponent - or play against a friend in our <strong>online multiplayer mode</strong>! Customize the match's rules to your liking!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About</h2>Tails of War was created by a 45 person multidisciplinary team over two semesters at the University of Michigan's WolverineSoft Studio, a student games studio undertaking semester-long projects. It is an educational case study of Wargroove, and takes inspiration from its game mechanics as well as other games in the genre. Work on this project took place between May 2023 to January 2024.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Command an army to face off against your feline foes in a game of strategy, wits, and whiskers.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687500/extras/01f408b10920e660f56359d36993a660.avif?t=1706299780\" width=590 height=472 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Champions</h2><strong>Vibrant cast of 6 unique champions - </strong> Pick from six unique champions from the desert, grassland, and tundra kingdom. Discover their unique personalities through their voice acting. <br><strong>Use Your Specials to Turn the Tide of Battle - </strong> Each faction gives their champion a unique special ability. Spawn an ally from thin air to defend yourself as a tundra champion. Move an extra turn to get a kill on a faraway enemy as a grass champion. Teleport yourself out of harms way as a desert champion.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687500/extras/489eb49dbf7f6826bd6a856f0257d806.avif?t=1706299780\" width=588 height=184 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Units</h2><strong>Wide Array of 8 Different Units - </strong> Spawn from a selection of 8 different units on the ground and in the air! Utilize their strengths and weaknesses to gain an edge in combat.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategy</h2><strong>Position Your Units on Advantageous Terrains - </strong> Head into the mountains to escape an assassin. Use the cover of the forests to defend yourself from attacks.<br><strong>Give your units a boost - </strong> Capture Artifacts of Power and Key Locations to give yourself and your units a strategic edge. Artifacts of Power give buffs to the unit that captures it for as long as they live. Key Locations give entire team-wide buffs to whichever team holds the location.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer</h2>Play against a computer controlled opponent - or play against a friend in our <strong>online multiplayer mode</strong>! Customize the match's rules to your liking!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About</h2>Tails of War was created by a 45 person multidisciplinary team over two semesters at the University of Michigan's WolverineSoft Studio, a student games studio undertaking semester-long projects. It is an educational case study of Wargroove, and takes inspiration from its game mechanics as well as other games in the genre. Work on this project took place between May 2023 to January 2024.",
    "short_description": "Command an army to face off against your feline foes in a game of strategy, wits, and whiskers. Capture cities, use special abilities, obtain Artifacts of Power, and spawn units in this turn-based battle for strategic dominance against your opponents - in both solo play and online multiplayer",
